{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xZZgVJijvg1794447880.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐洲多國數千間學校收到炸彈恐嚇電郵，意大利一度疏散師生，調查後無發現危險。</p><p></p><p>在意大利首都羅馬一間學校，師生疏散後在校外聚集。意大利教育部表示，全國超過6,300間學校，周三收到炸彈恐嚇電郵，但警方搜查後證實無危險。當地傳媒報道，電郵以俄文名稱署名，總理梅洛尼亦是恐嚇對象。</p><p></p><p>英國蘇格蘭與北愛爾蘭以及愛爾蘭，合共1,000多間學校，亦收到類似的恐嚇，但警方評估認為不可信，學校沒有疏散。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:43:55.000014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T01:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.498401+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:13.873210+00:00","content_hash":"77209f145733677fa08d18376847d621401e397d3e2fc74efb794345d4d86dc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:43:55.000014+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}